--- !u!114 &8611013492376917243
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7187719109279447997}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0f5a8379bd13ddf43b46cff2baab67e9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  AllHeadlines:
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline : Big Names Arrived!'
    headlineDescription: "Two big name factions have landed to A\u2019ea.  Marcel
      Trading Company arrived with five ships worth of personel and resources to
      scout the island for their resources. Meanwhile, in our humble town of Wavecrest,
      Chemy, a representative of the Alchemist Association has arrived to stay with
      us to learn more about our local flora and fauna. Lets give them a warm welcome
      and show the hospitality of the people of A\u2019ea."
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517454946664451
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Marcel Trading Company Opening Up Outpost'
    headlineDescription: "After the scouting process concluded yesterday, Marcel
      Trading Company decides to stay in A\u2019ea decides to stay in A\u2019ea for
      a while. They plan to open up outpost across the island to extract the resources
      and commercialize them globally. Marcel Trading Company promises to promote
      our island to increase trade in return for allowing them to gather resources
      from our island. This endeavor might finally put our island on the map."
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517454946664452
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: New Mayor Elected in Frostshine'
    headlineDescription: 'Mr. White, a representative of Marcel Trading Company was
      elected as the new mayor for the frosty town of Frostshine. After occupying
      the town, Marcel Trading Company managed to provide heating alternatives for
      the citizen of Frostshine. Thanks to their industrialized heater, citizens
      of Frostshine no longer need to worry about preserving fuel to keep warm throughout
      the year. '
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517474069282832
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Winterfest is Drawing Near'
    headlineDescription: As summer is reaching its end comes time to reflect on all
      that happened within this season and look forward to the festivities of winter.
      This Summer, many new faces have been welcomed into our lovely island. For
      this Winterfest, the island plans to go all out to celebrate their new guests.
      We hope everyone is excited to celebrate the festivities with family and friends.
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517474069282833
  - headlineText: 'Main Headline: Peaceful Times'
    headlineDescription: "Another quiet day has passed on A\u2019ea. The people of
      Wavecrest continue their daily lives, and all remains peaceful across the island.
      There are no major happenings to report today, so we wish everyone a safe and
      pleasant day until the next edition of the paper.\r"
    headlineImage: {fileID: 0}
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 1115517554788139031
  AllLocalRequests:
  - requestText: 'Local Request: Farm Boy Kenneth'
    requestDescription: "Due to his brothers being currently out of town to buy supplies
      for the farm, Kenneth doesn\u2019t have enough time to complete his daily chores
      on the farm. Help him by creating a @Swift potion."
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4638114a12e868c46af3e9f51d3ce539, type: 3}
    questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2cc601d7eb1a0d34482f68c1aee0b8ad, type: 2}
    followUpNewsId: local_kenneth_swiftpotion
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 5999243491663675400
      - rid: 1115517454946664449
  - requestText: 'Local Request 2 : Mr. Tidus'
    requestDescription: Due to strong winds near the port, his hat is stuck suspended
      in the air. help him by making a @jump potion to retrieve the hat.
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cd167975a92cd984486c99af8afa0c28, type: 3}
    questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f5bdccf78fbf44e42a3b9e297cd5f6e0, type: 2}
    followUpNewsId: local_tidus_jumppotion
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 5999243491663675401
      - rid: 1115517454946664450
  - requestText: 'Local Request: Mr. Ramonts'
    requestDescription: "His sister is coming to visit him and she usually cooks
      a lot. Mr. Ramonts is usually unable to finish all the food she makes,which
      always leaves him feeling guilty. Make him a Hunger potion to help him digest
      all of his sister\u2019s food."
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9ee4eeedc1601d746833a666b166a55f, type: 3}
    questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c423125d58279614da7406928ae1a71a, type: 2}
    followUpNewsId: local_ramonts_hungerpotion
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 5999243491663675397
      - rid: 5999243491663675402
      - rid: 1115517454946664453
  - requestText: 'Local Request: Bookworm Violette'
    requestDescription: Bookworm Violette has trouble sleeping at night due to always
      thinking about the next book she wants to read. This make her feel tired everyday
      and reduces her enjoyment when reading books. Make her a Sleep Potion to help
      her sleep at night.
    requestImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3f49ef8e09df5349b6b2165575c2b74, type: 3}
    questData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: df592cb421d85384a83ff7d844309bcd, type: 2}
    followUpNewsId: local_violette_sleeppotion
    requirementsToBeShown:
      requirements:
      - rid: 5999243491663675398
      - rid: 5999243491663675403
      - rid: 1115517454946664454
  AllLocalNews:
  - newsId: local_kenneth_swiftpotion
    newsText: 'Local News: Farm Boy Kenneth is On a Roll'
    newsDescription: "Yesterday, Farm Boy Kenneth came to the market place with two
      full carts of corn and cabbages. For a boy who is managing the farm alone,
      that is a LOT. Our reported asked him, how did he manage to do all this work
      in one day?.  Farm Boy Kenneth responded with \u201C Thanks the the potion
      Chemy gave me, I feel like I can work all day without getting tired!\u201D.
      We hope he doesn\u2019t overwork himself while his brothers are away."
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 0
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 0
  - newsId: local_ramonts_hungerpotion
    newsText: 'Local News: Mr. Ramonts Found unconscious on the Inn Floor'
    newsDescription: "Early rising customer found the inn owner Mr. Ramonts immobilized
      on the floor of the inn this morning. Witness accounts that Mr. Ramonts was
      groaning on the floor while mumbling \u201C No more\u2026 It cant fit\u2026\u201D.
      After providing him proper treatment and care, Mr. Ramonts said \u201CEven
      with the hunger potion, my sister\u2019s food was still too much.\u201D"
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 0
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 0
  - newsId: local_sven_spoon
    newsText: 'Local News: Old Man Sven Found His Lucky Spoon, Again!'
    newsDescription: "After losing his lucky spoon for 4 days, Post Girl Poshe found
      it inside the fountain in town square while trying to retrieve her hat. We
      still don\u2019t know how it got there but lets hope Old Man Sven won\u2019t
      lose it again."
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 1
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 0
  - newsId: peace
    newsText: 'Local News: Peaceful Days'
    newsDescription: "Life carries on peacefully in Wavecrest, with friendly faces
      filling the streets and warm smiles shared between neighbors. The town has
      enjoyed another quiet day, with everyone tending to their daily routines and
      lending a helping hand where needed. We are happy to report that all remains
      well, and we hope the days ahead continue to bring the same peace and cheer
      to our beloved town.\r"
    newsImage: {fileID: 0}
    willBeShown: 1
    hasBeenShown: 0
    canAlwaysShow: 1
